<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ ALL OUT FOR 390 VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ ALL OUT FOR 390 VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were all out for 390 runs against England in their first innings on the second day of the first of three test matches on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings - (overnight 233 for five) S.Fleming 129, C.Cairns 67; D.Cork three for 96, D.Gough four for 91).</p>
